===Recall the memories on Acheron{{subst:void|<!--103130105-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:{{tx}}

;(Talk to Jno)
:'''Jno:''' Oh, the perceptive individual who found me!
:{{Диалог}} I have something for you.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Are you really a Pepeshi?
:::'''Jno:''' No, of course not. I'm a Red Clayform from Kalsas, and this form is a result of my mimicry.
:::'''Jno:''' I was worried that my true appearance might frighten everyone, so I changed my form and became a Pepeshi. I heard they're super popular in the universe.
:::'''Jno:''' Don't you think... I look cute?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You are cute.
::::'''Jno:''' Heehee... it took me quite some time. I'm glad you find it appealing!
::::'''Jno:''' Anyway, I'll stick with this form in front of others. Just treat me as a Pepeshi.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Not cute.
::::'''Jno:''' Huh... your taste is so different from the others! Everyone else seems to think it's cute...
::::'''Jno:''' Anyway, I'll stick with this form in front of others. Just treat me as a Pepeshi.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} How did you get an invitation?
:::'''Jno:''' Heehee, maybe you don't know, but I'm one of the most talented individuals on my home planet!
:::'''Jno:''' I was the first to fly in a Kinetic Propulsion Chair and land safely. The tall guys in IPC even call me a space hero!
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} A Kinetic Propulsion Chair?
::::'''Jno:''' We Clayforms needed IPC services for interstellar travel, and it cost us a significant amount of credits just to clean the decks.
::::'''Jno:''' So, my friends and I developed the Kinetic Propulsion Chair, a special way for us Clayforms to travel through space.
::::'''Jno:''' Just attach several Disposable Kinetic Cannons to a chair and fire them all at once, and you'll get enough power to launch yourself from the planet.
::::'''Jno:''' Well, in my case, I didn't attach enough cannons that time, so I only made it up to the clouds before falling back down.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you land safely?
::::'''Jno:''' Heehee, that's an interesting story...
::::'''Jno:''' While we Clayforms walk on two feet, our bodies can actually stretch and take on any shape.
::::'''Jno:''' When I was up in the air, I stretched myself into a pancake-like form to catch more air and eventually safely landed on the ground.
::::'''Jno:''' The tall guys in IPC mentioned that it's akin to your "parachute," and I can do it with my body. Pretty impressive, right?
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Don't you dissolve in water?
:::'''Jno:''' Well... we do dissolve upon contact with water. That's why the rainy season has always been the greatest hazard on Kalsas.
:::'''Jno:''' Fortunately, IPC has recognized our value and constructed rain shelters on the planet. As a result, disappearances during rainfall are now few and far between.
:::'''Jno:''' Still, we must be careful when visiting other planets and never enter a bathroom.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} Thank you.
:::'''Jno:''' Well, come and play with me next time.
:{{Диалог|Рука}} Can I touch the fluff ball on your head?
:;(If {{cx}}<!--Hidden Mission ID 4040308--> has been completed)
:::'''Jno:''' Well... I feel a bit embarrassed after what happened last time. Let's forget it...
:;(If {{cx}}<!--Hidden Mission ID 4040308--> has not been completed)
:::'''Jno:''' Fluff ball? I'm not sure what you have in mind, but go ahead and touch it if you really want to.
:::You run your hand over Jno's fluff ball. Jno enjoys it, much like a happy kitten getting some pets...
:::'''Jno:''' Hmm... what is this? It feels so unusual...
:::Pepeshi rarely allows anyone to touch their fluff ball, just like how a human wouldn't let a stranger pick their ear. However, Jno is not a real Pepeshi.
:::'''Jno:''' Keep doing that. Don't stop...
:::{{Диалог|Выход}} Pepeshi rarely allows others to touch their fluff ball.
::::'''Jno:''' Oh? I&mdash;Is that so? I suppose I still have much to learn...
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Keep petting it.
::::'''Jno:''' Purrrrrrr...
::::Jno lifts the head and purrs contentedly, like a cat getting a good scratch.
::::'''Jno:''' Would you pet me again?
::::{{Диалог|Выход}} Pepeshi rarely allows others to touch their fluff ball.
:::::'''Jno:''' I&mdash;Is that so? But you just...
:::::'''Jno:''' Well, forget it. I'm not a real Pepeshi anyway. I suppose I still have much to learn...
::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Pet Jno again.
:::::The fluff ball wobbles as your fingertips move, almost as if it is going to lose its solid form...
:::::'''Jno:''' So comforting... like rolling around in a muddy pond...
::::;(Screen fades to black)
:::::The "Pepeshi" starts to secrete an unusual sweat...
:::::Sticky fluids trickle down Jno's body and form gel-like clumps... From the looks of it, it is the latest cooling gel.
:::::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What was that just now?
:::::'''Jno:''' ...
:::::'''Jno:''' You can have it!
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Thank you.
::'''Jno:''' Well, come and play with me next time.
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Regarding the Moment of Daybreak...
::'''Welt:''' The Moment of Daybreak &mdash; I've heard that's where the "Dawn Factory," which processes the foundation of the Dreamscape, is located.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Regarding the Gilded Hour...
::'''Welt:''' Gilded Hour... It's said to be Penacony's Currency Center.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the Blue Hour...
::'''Welt:''' I hear the Blue Hour is very romantic. Do you have any tales to share?
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} About the Moment of Dusk...
::'''Welt:''' The Dreamscape of chic, luxury and consumerism &mdash; the Moment of Dusk &mdash; my companions have been there too.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's everything.
::'''Acheron:''' This is what I've seen and heard along the way...
::{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
